-- One-time data update: Åre Run gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout (Moses, 15 Nov 2026: the World Tour re-layouts): until now it
-- was physically the same track as Greenland Expedition. A rumble start down
-- the summit's mogul field (the field let go in waves), the hairpin, a sweep
-- under the gondola line, down the World Championship slope (the big feature
-- and new signature), the funicular spiral, S-bends through the village and the
-- run to the frozen lake. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its track
-- record, country records and players' personal bests start again from now
-- (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
-- Generated from src/game/physicsTracks.js by scripts/physics-track-sql.js --relayout.
-- Only the Åre Run track row changes.

